        If you buy wire mesh from China, you are almost certainly buying from Hebei Province — whether you know it or not. The cluster around Anping County, in Hengshui prefecture, produces by most industry estimates more than 60% of China's wire mesh and an even larger share of its exports. Buyers often compare "three different suppliers" on Alibaba whose offices stand within two kilometers of each other.
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        Understanding how the cluster is organized — who actually manufactures, who trades, and which pocket of the county specializes in your product — is the biggest advantage an overseas buyer can have. For background, see our <a href="/sourcing-guide/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">wire mesh sourcing guide</a> and the <a href="/wire-mesh-hebei/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">Hebei wire mesh overview</a>.
      </p>
