              <td class="p-3">Genuine 30–50% savings vs. domestic distributors</td>
              <td class="p-3">Little room for factories to absorb steel price spikes; some renegotiate or quietly down-spec</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Response times collapse</td>
              <td class="p-3">Quotes within hours, even overnight for China-time buyers</td>
